  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Slice brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Trim Fioretto. Halve any thicker stalks of Fioretto lengthways.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-ef5f8700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place potato, carrot and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-52cfc510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 15 minutes remaining, place Fioretto on a second lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender and brown around edges, 10-15 minutes.\n• In the last 5 minutes of cook time, drizzle over the honey and balsamic vinegar and roast until sticky.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-38ac7f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Add tomato & herb seasoning and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-d5279c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To tray with roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-31d5a840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide balsamic roasted Fioretto, veggie toss and herby tomato plant-based crumbed chicken between plates.\n• Serve with Italian truffle mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185c805fc1830ec44f105/step-5b99e550.jpg"
    }
  ]
